  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a cozy haven with the Jeminise Comforter Set. Crafted for ultimate comfort and style, this set brings a touch of unique charm to your sleeping space, ensuring a restful night’s sleep with its soft and breathable materials.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Filled with finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This 5-piece bedding set includes one comforter (68\" x 90\"), one flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), one fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish patterns and exquisite stitching that enhances durability and prevents filling from shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit:</strong> The fitted sheet has a deep pocket design with an elastic band on all four sides, accommodating mattresses up to 14 inches thick.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for all seasons, including Fall, Summer, and Winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Selected Design:</strong> Features a captivating Pumpkin, Ghost, Bats pattern with a Horror Cartoon theme.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin,Ghost,Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>14 inches Fitted Sheet Depth</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
